  "bodyHash": "ZTaeF5abmyc=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的眾多活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>可設定生物藥水效果是一個伺服器端模組，讓管理員能為任何生物賦予永久藥水效果，並設定當生物攻擊目標時，對目標施加的藥水效果。此模組完全可設定，適用於所有模組中的實體和藥水效果。預設情況下，模組不會執行任何操作，控制權完全在於你。<br><br>共有兩個設定檔，均位於資料夾「<em>./config/configurablemobpotioneffects/</em>」中。<br>一個稱為「<em>permanenteffects.txt</em>」。在此你可以為任何生物添加永久藥水效果。<br>另一個稱為「<em>ondamageeffects.txt</em>」。在此你可以設定任何生物對受損目標應施加的藥水效果。<br><br>設定檔在模組首次載入時產生。如果你添加了任何模組中的實體或藥水效果，請刪除這些檔案並重新載入遊戲一次。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg&w=832\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的自訂組合包\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><em>/cmpe reload</em> - 重新載入對設定檔的所有手動更改。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示劇透</summary>\n<p><span><span>首次載入後，設定檔包含所有可能的實體和所有可能的藥水效果。等級設為 0 時，所有效果皆預設停用。你只需找到正確的行並更改數值即可。<br><br>「<em>permanenteffects.txt</em>」設定檔：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"167\"><br><br><span>「<em>ondamageeffects.txt</em>」設定檔：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"214\"></span></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>讓我們讓所有史萊姆速度超快，永久的加速效果等級為 50。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>在「<em>./config/configurablemobpotioneffects/permanenteffects.txt</em>」中找到史萊姆區段：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"126\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>找到加速藥水效果區段：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"125\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>將等級設為 50：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"125\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>重新啟動遊戲或使用 <em>/cmpe reload</em>，然後見證奇蹟發生：</strong></p>\n<details><summary>顯示劇透</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"560\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><br>另一個例子，讓我們讓終界蟎的攻擊給予目標懸浮效果等級 10，持續 1 秒。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>在「<em>./config/configurablemobpotioneffects/ondamageeffects.txt</em>」中找到終界蟎：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/g.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1356\" height=\"189\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>找到懸浮區段：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"156\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>將懸浮等級設為 10：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"156\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>將持續時間設為 1 秒：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"155\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>重新啟動遊戲或使用 <em>/cmpe reload</em>，然後和那隻終界蟎戰鬥吧！</strong></p>\n<details><summary>顯示劇透</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/k.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"564\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>最後一個例子，讓我們讓殭屍跑得飛快，並在攻擊時使目標中毒：<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>在「<em>permanenteffects.txt</em>」中找到殭屍，並將加速等級設為 5：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"124\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>在「<em>ondamageeffects.txt</em>」中找到殭屍區段，將中毒等級設為 2，持續時間 5 秒保持不變即可：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/m.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"154\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>重新啟動遊戲或使用 <em>/cmpe reload</em>，大功告成！這就是那隻殭屍：</strong></p>\n<details><summary>顯示劇透</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-mob-potion-effects/n.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><strong>輪到你了！ :)</strong></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，前提是下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
